    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u0418\u0433\u0440\u0430 \u0438\u0449\u0435\u0442 \u0438\u0437\u0434\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044f \u043d\u0430 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0441\u043e\u043b\u0438! \u041f\u0438\u0448\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043d\u0430 \u043f\u043e\u0447\u0442\u0443 <a href=\"mailto:studiovictoriagames@gmail.com\">studiovictoriagames@gmail.com</a></h2>The cat, named <strong>serious Sam</strong>, is very upset when the house is in order and everything is in its place. <br>Help Sam get inner peace.<br>The main task of the game is to spoil the life of the residents of the house. Playing as a cat, you will need to destroy everything around and not get caught by the owners of the house. Improvise, think over your moves in advance. <br><strong>Happy New Year from &quot;Victoria Game&quot;</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256230/extras/13690e74f53c9448da019012fbfcf781.avif?t=1728246808\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256230/extras/aead26b45a19ddb827b4c6dacaf96e94.avif?t=1728246808\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features of the game</h2></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>16 levels (we are sure you will not be able to pass all the levels from 1 time).<br></li><li>Colorful graphics.<br></li><li>Funny pranks (we broke our heads here while we came up with everything).<br></li><li>Some levels are very difficult (test your strength).<br></li><li>All this with cheerful music! \ud83d\ude0e<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256230/extras/e6e599b0fa651c1488820a114959a82a.avif?t=1728246808\" /></span></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u0418\u0433\u0440\u0430 \u0438\u0449\u0435\u0442 \u0438\u0437\u0434\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044f \u043d\u0430 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0441\u043e\u043b\u0438! \u041f\u0438\u0448\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043d\u0430 \u043f\u043e\u0447\u0442\u0443 <a href=\"mailto:studiovictoriagames@gmail.com\">studiovictoriagames@gmail.com</a></h2>The cat, named <strong>serious Sam</strong>, is very upset when the house is in order and everything is in its place. <br>Help Sam get inner peace.<br>The main task of the game is to spoil the life of the residents of the house. Playing as a cat, you will need to destroy everything around and not get caught by the owners of the house. Improvise, think over your moves in advance. <br><strong>Happy New Year from &quot;Victoria Game&quot;</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256230/extras/13690e74f53c9448da019012fbfcf781.avif?t=1728246808\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256230/extras/aead26b45a19ddb827b4c6dacaf96e94.avif?t=1728246808\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features of the game</h2></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>16 levels (we are sure you will not be able to pass all the levels from 1 time).<br></li><li>Colorful graphics.<br></li><li>Funny pranks (we broke our heads here while we came up with everything).<br></li><li>Some levels are very difficult (test your strength).<br></li><li>All this with cheerful music! \ud83d\ude0e<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256230/extras/e6e599b0fa651c1488820a114959a82a.avif?t=1728246808\" /></span></li></ul>",
